criterion = "The original registration integration proof now runs here unchanged through the same prove_registration_resolution helper. The existing managed_registration_resolves_restored_subject_reads_and_writes library case still calls the same helper with durable peer restoration. The integration target additionally proves a real producer registration remains refused while queued before and after restart."

[include.tls_exchange]
